  "description": "Powerful 250W Brushless Motor for Smooth City Rides\n\nEquipped with a 250W high-torque brushless hub motor delivering 40 N.M torque, this city ebike hits a max speed of 20 MPH and supports a maximum riding range up to 50 miles per full charge. Perfect for daily urban commutes, short trips and casual leisure cycling on flat & gentle hilly roads.\n\nComfort & Shock Absorption with Adjustable Front Suspension\n\nFeatures an adjustable suspension front fork that effectively filters road bumps and uneven pavement. It greatly boosts riding stability, reduces long-distance fatigue and adapts to various city terrains, bringing you a softer, more comfortable cycling experience than rigid forks.\n\nReliable Safety Components for Daily Commuting\n\nComes with front & rear dual disc brake system for instant, stable stopping power even at high speeds or during emergency braking. Matched with full-coverage mud fenders to block splashing water and mud on rainy days, keeping your clothes clean in all weather conditions.\n\nShimano 7-Speed Drivetrain & Practical Cargo Rear Rack\n\nBuilt with original Shimano 7-speed rear derailleur paired with microSHIFT twist shifter, enabling smooth, precise gear shifting to match different road conditions. Upgraded heavy-duty sturdy rear rack with strong load capacity allows you to mount bags, baskets or luggage for shopping and daily errands.\n\nStep-Through Frame & User-Friendly Complete Configuration\n\nLow step-through frame design makes mounting & dismounting effortless for riders of all ages. This electric bicycle arrives 85% pre-assembled for quick setup, fitted with a removable rechargeable battery, LCD display, 700C city wheels, and all essential accessories for ready-to-go urban riding.",
